        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Noonan\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director, Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay\n- Organizations: Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences\n- Places: Sydney, Australia\n- Works: Babe\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Noonan was born on 14 November 1952.\n- Chris Noonan is a Sydney-based Australian filmmaker and actor.\n- Chris Noonan is best known for the family film \"Babe\" released in 1995.\n- Chris Noonan was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for \"Babe.\"\n- Chris Noonan was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Adapted Screenplay for \"Babe.\"\n- The Academy Award for Best Director is officially known as the Academy Award for Best Directing.\n- The Academy Award for Best Director is presented annually by the Academy of Motion Picture Arts and Sciences.",
